  "allOf":[{"if":{"properties":{"decision":{"const":"CONCURRED"}},"required":["decision"]},"then":{"properties":{"discrepancyCodes":{"maxItems":0}}}},{"if":{"properties":{"decision":{"const":"DISCREPANCY"}},"required":["decision"]},"then":{"properties":{"discrepancyCodes":{"minItems":1}}}}],
